    "name": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSetReadAll QueryAsync family",
    "kind": "Library",
    "contract": "Executes a query contract across every shard in a shard set, or across the shards named by supplied shard-specific values. A caller-provided thread-safe handler converts each shard result to TModel; the completed task yields the combined non-null TModel results. Generic variants may pass a TArg context object to that handler.",
